 "remarks": "There is much more house than meets the eye in this immaculately renovated colonial is MOVE IN ready in the heart of Springdale. New roof, new paved driveway, lovely backyard and space for you and your family. Beautiful fireplace, natural lighting galore; renovated bathrooms, refinished floors. 2nd floor was completed in 2000. Very conveniently located walking distance to shops, restaurants and Metro North train station. Full finished basement with unlimited possibilities. Renovated kitchen and stainless steel appliances, deck with BBQ area and a beautiful outdoor space for entertainment. CAT 5/6 hardwired through out the house. Very spacious bedrooms and main bedroom features a walk-in closet; office with amazing closet space as well (perfect if you work from home).  Don't miss this one!!",
